    </p>

    <h2>2. Problem Statement</h2>
    <p>
        People with physical and sensory disabilities face significant barriers in "smart cities" that focus more on efficiency than inclusivity. The lack of adaptive, real-time sensory feedback makes navigation in high-density urban areas difficult and often isolating.
    </p>

