    </ul>

    <h2>4. Methodology</h2>
    <p>
        The project will utilize a mixed-methods approach:
    </p>
    <ul>
        <li><strong>Phase I: Ethnographic Field Studies:</strong> Observing the daily navigation challenges of persons with mobility-related disabilities.</li>
